Spec: Real cross-language mTLS control fixture

Purpose:
  Exercise independent Agent clients against the actual server control service and durable authority.

Owns:
  ./main.go

Must:
  Read only public P-256 CSRs from a preprotected ignored fixture directory and keep the owner root and server private keys in process.
  Listen only on loopback with bounded lifetime, issue exact owner/publisher/visitor roles and service grants, and publish only public configuration.
  Permit fixture-only revocation and epoch restart through a bounded file marker in the owned directory, never through an unauthenticated network administration endpoint.
  Close server and storage on exit; emit only fixed status and never tokens or private keys.
